Java Quiz App
This is a console-based Quiz Application developed in Java. The app allows users to attempt multiple-choice questions, calculate their results, 
and view the answer key at the end. It also includes features like file saving.
Features:
🔀 Randomly shuffled questions on every run

📝 Multiple-choice questions with user input

✔️ Answer validation and result calculation

📄 Automatically displays the correct answer key

💾 Saves questions and answers to a text file

How It Works:
The user is asked a series of multiple-choice questions.

Each question is presented one by one.

At the end, the program shows the number of correct answers and the full answer key.

All data is optionally written to a file for record keeping.

